---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service — Betva" description="Read the Betva Terms of Service before registering, paying, posting, or betting." active="" hideNav>
  <div class="page-frame page-frame-narrow space-y-4">
    <header class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Terms of Service</h1>
      <a href="/register" class="tap-link text-sm text-[var(--brand)]">Register</a>
    </header>

    <div class="glass p-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-2)] space-y-4">
      <p><strong>Version 2</strong> · Last updated 16 November 2026. By registering, paying, posting, or betting you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use Betva.</p>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">1. Who may use Betva</h2>
        <p>You must be 18 or older and legally able to enter this agreement in Tanzania. You must use your own phone number and the official name registered to that number. One person, one account.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">2. The single official payment number</h2>
        <p>There is <strong>only one official payment number</strong>. It is <strong id="terms-number">the number shown on your Profile page</strong>, registered to <strong id="terms-name">the account owner shown on your Profile</strong>. No other number, agent, or person is authorised to collect money for Betva.</p>
        <p>Pay only that number. Send money to any other number, user, or person at your own risk: the admin cannot trace, refund, or be held responsible for money sent anywhere else. The admin will never ask you to pay a different number in chat, a call, or a message. If someone does, do not pay them and report it.</p>
        <p><strong>What the payment is for:</strong> maintaining Betva and paying for internet service so the website stays available always. It is a contribution to running costs, not a fee for a guaranteed result.</p>
        <p>Payment does not activate your account by itself. After payment, ask the admin to activate your account. Access starts only when the admin marks your account active; access has an expiry date shown on your Profile.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">3. No wallet is shown to users</h2>
        <p>Money is handled between you and the admin. Betva does not show you a wallet balance or movement list. Stakes, results, and corrections are recorded internally for fairness and audit, but the admin is the only person who sees balances. Do not treat any screenshot or message from another user as proof of funds or of a payment.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">4. Betting rules</h2>
        <p>Only two markets exist: Full Time Over 0.5 Goals and Over 0.5 Half Time. Only fixed stake tiers are accepted. Betting closes at kickoff (Africa/Dar_es_Salaam). A win pays the published multiplier; a loss is final and always shown in your History. Postponed matches are refunded. Corrections after settlement are added as reversing entries — the original result stays visible.</p>
        <p>Bets are a form of entertainment, not a source of income. Outcomes are never guaranteed. You may set a 24-hour, 7-day, or 30-day self-exclusion; it cannot be shortened.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">5. Community posts and your responsibility</h2>
        <p>The community is a shared space. You are fully responsible for anything you post, upload, or write. Do not post:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>illegal content, threats, harassment, hate speech, or abuse;</li>
          <li>sexual content, violence, or content harmful to children;</li>
          <li>scams, fake results, fake payment proof, impersonation, or scraping of other people’s photos/videos;</li>
          <li>other people’s private information, phone numbers, or addresses;</li>
          <li>spam, advertising, or links to outside payment or betting sites.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You may share sports discussion and entertainment videos you have the right to share. Do not upload content you do not own. The admin may hide, remove, or report any post, and may suspend or ban an account, without prior notice. Three distinct reports automatically hide a post.</p>
        <p><strong>Betva is not responsible for content posted by users.</strong> Other users’ opinions, videos, and claims are their own, not the admin’s. Do not rely on them for betting decisions. Betva is not affiliated with any football club, league, or team named on the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">6. Notifications and data</h2>
        <p>The in-app inbox is the authoritative record of results and account messages. Push notifications are best-effort and can fail. You can mute categories and turn push off. We store only the data needed to run the service: your phone number, official name, activity, bets, posts, and consent record. Results are kept in an append-only archive for six months.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">7. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>When these terms change, the version number above changes and you will be asked to accept the new version before continuing. The version you accepted is recorded with a timestamp when you register.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary w-full">Back to register</a>
  </div>

  <script>
    import { API } from '../lib/api';
    fetch(`${API}/api/v1/config`)
      .then((res) => (res.ok ? res.json() : {}))
      .then((cfg) => {
        if (cfg.payment_number) {
          const n = document.getElementById('terms-number');
          if (n) n.textContent = String(cfg.payment_number);
        }
        if (cfg.payment_name) {
          const n = document.getElementById('terms-name');
          if (n) n.textContent = String(cfg.payment_name);
        }
      })
      .catch(() => {});
  </script>
</Layout>
